00:26:01.760 --> 00:26:10.710
...what kind of love would I go through...

00:26:12.320 --> 00:26:22.510
 ...if I were to reach that light ?

00:26:37.860 --> 00:26:42.820
Preview of Next Episode

00:26:38.740 --> 00:26:41.700
Having confirmed the presence of
the Alliance base on Van-Fleet 4-2...

00:26:41.700 --> 00:26:44.660
...the Imperial fleet appointed
Luneberg to lead the ground assault.

00:26:44.660 --> 00:26:48.020
Reinhard was assigned to be the sub-captain
of the troops, which frustrated him...

00:26:48.020 --> 00:26:50.630
...and Kircheis worried
over the danger of it.

00:26:50.630 --> 00:26:54.600
On the other hand, the Alliance has
difficulty deploying a defensive line.

00:26:54.600 --> 00:26:57.680
In the midst of it all, the Imperial
troops launch a full-frontal assault.

